80
00:02:43.956 --> 00:02:46.245
(audience cheers)
(audience applauds)

81
00:02:46.245 --> 00:02:48.470
Yeah.

82
00:02:48.470 --> 00:02:53.137
That show is so avant-garde, cool, weird, interesting.

83
00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:55.710
It's so wild.

84
00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:59.700
Yeah, it's really a very interesting tone.

85
00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:01.980 line:15%
It's about this Lumon Industries,

86
00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:06.410 line:15%
and certain people that work there decide

87
00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:08.290 line:15%
to go through this procedure called severance

88
00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:10.930
where they separate a part of their brain.

89
00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:13.780
So their part of them that goes to work

90
00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:15.560
doesn't remember their home life.

91
00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:17.010
And the part of them that's at home

92
00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:19.250
doesn't remember their work life.

93
00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:21.640
And I play this upper management woman

94
00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:26.720
who's sort of overseeing this department.

95
00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:31.720
It just begs such a rich, wild, impossible,

96
00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:32.910
but like, I don't know

97
00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:34.700
what's impossible anymore in the world.

98
00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:35.533
Everything-

99
00:03:35.533 --> 00:03:37.670
Yeah.
Maybe is possible, and-

100
00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:39.200
Yeah.
It is just such a ride

101
00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:40.033
of a show.

102
00:03:40.033 --> 00:03:41.408
Congratulations on it

103
00:03:41.408 --> 00:03:42.241
getting picked up.
Thank you.

104
00:03:42.241 --> 00:03:43.111
Don't ever get severed.

105
00:03:43.111 --> 00:03:44.050
(audience applauds)

106
00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:45.053
That's all I have to say.

107
00:03:45.053 --> 00:03:46.980
No. (laughs)

108
00:03:46.980 --> 00:03:49.170
We have a clip here, actually.

109
00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:51.380
Will you please roll that for us?

110
00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:54.047
(switch clicks)

111
00:03:55.552 --> 00:03:57.240
Or were you sniffing around other departments

112
00:03:57.240 --> 00:04:00.643
